Subject: [PATCH 109/109] docs: gpu: document the Vino driver

Document supported hardware, configuration and diagnostics, KMS
behaviour, validated timing profiles, coherent snapshots and damage
accounting, encrypted control sessions, recovery, monitor handling,
teardown, and build-time validation.

Keep reverse-engineering evidence and capture history in the companion
repository. Describe only the production driver contract and its
invariants in the in-tree document.

